{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike game inspired by <i>Brotato</i>. Perfect for players with limited time who want to skip story-driven content and jump straight into combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose from over 62 different stances, each offering unique buffs and debuffs, allowing players to strategically combine them based on the battle situation and their build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Weapon</strong>: Choose from 7 unique abilities (from 8 positions: Earth, Water, Fire, Wind, Thunder, Mountain, Marsh, and Heaven, with one default position that triggers no buff or debuff).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Wielding</strong>: Combine weapon positions to unlock up to 55 distinct ability combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Shop System</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers a variety of randomly generated items, weapons, and armor, each with diverse buffs. Combined with weapon position buffs, players can freely mix and match to create unique playstyles, unlocking endless combat possibilities!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791630?t=1773140229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791630/e2f58acd5b6217bbf585d07b69ecf7f296265842/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773140229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791630/da3eccae8ea270159bd3c5a34b6b1851ae013e0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773140229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791630/da3eccae8ea270159bd3c5a34b6b1851ae013e0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773140229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"not